<title>USA: Richardson Electronics names president.</title>
<headline>Richardson Electronics names president.</headline>
<dateline>LAFOX, Ill. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Richardson Electronics Ltd said Thursday Bruce Johnson would join the company as president and chief operating officer as well as a director.</p>
<p>He will report to Edward Richardson, who continues as chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Johnson was president of Premier Industrial Corp and also served as chief operating officer of its electronics group. Richardson Electronics acquired Premier Industrial in April.</p>
<p>Richardson Electronics manufactures electron tubes and power semiconductors.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
